  "Software Details": "软件详情",
  "The Partial Payment Module in eCommerceGo SAAS enables you to provide your customers with the flexibility of paying for their purchases in manageable installments. This feature is particularly beneficial for high-ticket items, making your products more accessible to a broader audience. By offering installment plans, you not only enhance customer satisfaction but also increase your sales potential. This flexibility allows customers to make larger purchases without the immediate burden of paying the full amount upfront, fostering a more positive buying experience.": "eCommerceGo SAAS 中的部分付款模块使您能够为客户提供以可管理的分期付款的灵活性。",
  "View Live Demo": "查看现场演示",
  "Control Over Deposits": "存款控制",
  "Customize the payment experience by enabling or disabling the force deposit button according to your business requirements. This feature allows you to decide whether an initial deposit is necessary for your customers to begin the installment plan. Having control over this setting ensures that you can adapt the payment process to suit different scenarios and customer preferences. This flexibility helps you maintain a balance between securing a commitment from the customer and providing a convenient payment option.": "根据您的业务需求启用或禁用强制存款按钮，自定义支付体验。",
  "Comprehensive Payment History": "综合付款历史",
  "The Partial Payment Module offers a comprehensive view of all partial payments made by your customers. You can effortlessly access detailed payment histories, including dates, amounts, and payment methods. This transparency helps you maintain accurate records, making it easier to manage finances and address any customer inquiries regarding their payment schedules. By having a clear and organized history of payments, you can ensure better financial management and customer service.": "部分付款模块提供了客户所进行的所有部分付款的全面视图。",
  "Real-Time Payment Status": "实时支付状态",
  "Stay informed about the status of each installment with real-time payment tracking. The module clearly indicates whether a payment has been made or is still pending. This feature helps you keep track of outstanding balances, ensuring that you can follow up with customers promptly and manage your cash flow more effectively. Knowing the payment status at a glance allows you to make informed decisions and take necessary actions to ensure timely payments.": "通过实时付款跟踪随时了解每期付款的状态。",
